    "gift_title": "A LETTER FROM GRANDPA WALT",
    "gift_text": "Kiddo,\n\nI heard you cleaned the old place up. I knew you would.\n\nNow the real rock is open to you: the hillside behind the yard. Cut it from the front, one section at a time, and it will give up good stone.\n\nI'm sending what I had put away. Spend it on a drill when you are ready. Machines are how we cut the big blocks.\n\n- Grandpa Walt"
